<p>You call upon the very core of the world, harnessing its power to transform your body.</p><p>For <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">14, 16, 17, 18, 18</acronym> turns you become a Deeprock Elemental, gaining two size categories.</p><p>This increases your Physical damage by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">20%, 26%, 30%, 33%, 36%</acronym> and Physical damage penetration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5.9%, 7.9%, 9.3%, 11%, 12%,</acronym> and armour by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7, 8, 9, 10, 11.</acronym></p><p>The effects increase with spellpower.</p>